"green heart of the city, it sits just minutes from the busiest boulevards, "
"yet feels like a different century altogether. The moment the doors open, "
"gilded walls, candlelit chandeliers, and rooms that stretch on in quiet "
"procession welcome you in, each one holding onto a little more history than "
"the last."
